msgid "No Content Security Policy headers are currently enabled."
msgstr "Er zijn momenteel geen Content Security Policy-headers ingeschakeld. "

msgid "Enable a header via <a href=\":csp-settings\">the Content Security Policy settings</a>."
msgstr "Schakel een header in via de <a href=\":csp-settings\">instellingen van Content Security Policy</a>."

msgid "Enabling Content Security Policy in Security Kit is likely to cause policy conflicts."
msgstr "Het inschakelen van Content Security Policy in Security Kit kan leiden tot beleidsconflicten."

msgid "Disable the Content Security Policy settings in <a href=\":seckit-settings\">Security Kit configuration</a>."
msgstr "De instellingen voor Content Security Policy in <a href=\":seckit-settings\">Security Kit configuration</a> uitschakelen."

